file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/src/retry_transport.py#L104-L116).\n     - Provides [`execute`](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/src/retry_transport.py#L254-L370) for arbitrary callable requests and [`send`](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/src/retry_transport.py#L372-L438) for direct `urllib.request.Request` / URL string execution.\n     - Supports `on_retry` callback hooks.\n\n2. **Mock Unit Test Suite:** [`src/test_retry_transport.py`](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/src/test_retry_transport.py)\n   - Comprehensive test suite covering config validation, backoff formula bounds, jitter distribution verification, `Retry-After` parsing (delta seconds and HTTP-dates), immediate successes, transient recovery, retry exhaustion, non-retryable status codes, exception handling, custom retry conditions, telemetry tracking, and mocked `urllib` calls.\n   - 100% mock execution with virtual sleeper (zero live network calls, sub-second execution).\n\n3. **Stage Contracts:**\n   - [`tasks/TSK-013/01_intake.md`](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tasks/TSK-013/01_intake.md)\n   - [`tasks/TSK-013/02_plan.md`](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tasks/TSK-013/02_plan.md)\n   - [`tasks/TSK-013/03_exec.md`](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tasks/TSK-013/03_exec.md)\n   - [`tasks/TSK-013/04_verify.md`](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tasks/TSK-013/04_verify.md)\n\n---\n\n### Automated Verification Results\n\nAll assertions passed via sanitized command execution through [`scripts/filter_output.py`](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/scripts/filter_output.py):\n- `python scripts/filter_output.py -- python -m unittest src/test_retry_transport.py` $\\rightarrow$ Exit 0\n- `python scripts/filter_output.py -- python -m pytest src/test_retry_transport.py` $\\rightarrow$ Exit 0\n- `python scripts/filter_output.py -- python scripts/lint_frontmatter.py` $\\rightarrow$ Exit 0\n","duration_seconds":48.2055467,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":82465,"ou